    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>WooCommerce Shipping Gateway Per Product</strong> allows you to configure and restrict shipping gateways on a per-product basis.</p>\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Assign specific shipping gateways to individual products.</li>\n<li>Restrict shipping gateways for selected products.</li>\n<li>Flexible settings for tailored e-commerce shipping options.</li>\n<li>Seamless integration with WooCommerce shipping zones.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This plugin is perfect for store owners who need fine-grained control over which shipping options are available based on the product being purchased.</p>\n<h3>Example Use Cases:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Offer premium shipping for select products.</li>\n<li>Restrict free shipping for heavy or oversized items.</li>\n<li>Configure product-specific shipping methods for digital or physical goods.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Get started today and enhance your WooCommerce store’s shipping capabilities!</strong></p>\n<h3>Support</h3>\n<p>For support and documentation, visit <a href=\"https://www.dreamfoxmedia.com/support\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Dreamfox Media Support</a>.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/woocommerce-shipping-gateway-per-product</code> directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Go to WooCommerce settings to configure shipping gateways for individual products.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='can%20i%20assign%20multiple%20shipping%20gateways%20to%20a%20product%3F'>\nCan I assign multiple shipping gateways to a product?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, you can select multiple shipping gateways for each product based on your preferences.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='is%20this%20plugin%20compatible%20with%20woocommerce%20subscriptions%3F'>\nIs this plugin compatible with WooCommerce subscriptions?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, this plugin works seamlessly with WooCommerce subscriptions and other extensions.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='how%20do%20i%20restrict%20certain%20shipping%20gateways%3F'>\nHow do I restrict certain shipping gateways?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Navigate to the product editing screen and configure the restricted shipping gateways under the &#8220;Shipping Options&#8221; tab.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.5.7</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update freemius SDK to 2.12.1</li>\n<li>Tested with WordPress and WooCommerce</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.5.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Bugfix refresh dropdown</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.5.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update freemius SDK to 2.11</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.5.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update freemius SDK to 2.10</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.5.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Tested with WordPress 6.4 and WooCommerce 9.4.2.</li>\n<li>Improved compatibility with WooCommerce multi-site setups.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.5.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor bug fixes and performance enhancements.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Assign specific shipping gateways for individual WooCommerce products to provide a customized shipping experience for your customers.",
    "description": "<p><strong>WooCommerce Shipping Gateway Per Product</strong> allows you to configure and restrict shipping gateways on a per-product basis.</p>\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Assign specific shipping gateways to individual products.</li>\n<li>Restrict shipping gateways for selected products.</li>\n<li>Flexible settings for tailored e-commerce shipping options.</li>\n<li>Seamless integration with WooCommerce shipping zones.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This plugin is perfect for store owners who need fine-grained control over which shipping options are available based on the product being purchased.</p>\n<h3>Example Use Cases:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Offer premium shipping for select products.</li>\n<li>Restrict free shipping for heavy or oversized items.</li>\n<li>Configure product-specific shipping methods for digital or physical goods.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Get started today and enhance your WooCommerce store’s shipping capabilities!</strong></p>\n<h3>Support</h3>\n<p>For support and documentation, visit <a href=\"https://www.dreamfoxmedia.com/support\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Dreamfox Media Support</a>.</p>\n",
